============================================================
29. HIGH-RISK RECRUITMENT SAFEGUARDS
============================================================

HireFlow must not:
- Automatically make hiring decisions
- Automatically reject candidates
- Infer sensitive personal characteristics
- Hide evidence behind an AI recommendation
- Present AI output as objective truth

Every important AI insight should follow:

Requirement
    +
Evidence
    +
AI Interpretation
    +
Uncertainty
    +
Human Review


============================================================
30. FAILURE STATES
============================================================

Resume parsing failure:
    "Unable to process this document."
    → Upload replacement

AI failure:
    "AI analysis is temporarily unavailable."
    → Retry

Missing evidence:
    "No supporting evidence was found."

Contradiction:
    "Potential inconsistency detected."
    → Review evidence

Low confidence:
    "Insufficient evidence to reliably evaluate this requirement."


